@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_28_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:如果在其他地方找不到亚里沙，<br>那她多半会在森林的湖畔。|#0102Adv12_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛参照以往的经验去了湖边，<br>但今天谁也不在。|#0102Adv12_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（扑了个空啊）|#0102Adv12_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这一带阴森森的，<br>让艾玛有些害怕。|#0102Adv12_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙为什么喜欢这个地方呢。|#0102Adv12_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:她自言自语道。|#0102Adv12_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——她觉得自己很可怕，<br>所以才总是呆在水边。|#0102Adv12_Nanoka001| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不知从哪里传来了声音，<br>艾玛吓了一跳，一下子抬起头来。|#0102Adv12_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

