[PrintTextModified Text:她从树丛间隐隐瞥见了奈叶香的身影。|#0102Adv12_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香！你之前都去哪了——|#0102Adv12_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Nanoka-Front,MainBackground-Front Lazy:false
@SpawnBlur ActorId:MainBackground-Front Intensity:0 FadeDuration:0
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:MaskingRectangle SubId:Front LogWarning:true
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香的身影立马消失了。|#0102Adv12_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香！你听我说——！|#0102Adv12_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚不是幕后黑手！<br>她是个很好的女孩，不，是个很好的人！|#0102Adv12_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:安安和可可<br>都特别黏着她。|#0102Adv12_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不只是她们。<br>米莉亚拯救了我们所有人！|#0102Adv12_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:求求你，不要再盯着米莉亚的性命<br>不放了！！|#0102Adv12_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:和我们一起<br>离开这里吧！！|#0102Adv12_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……我的目的不是离开这里。<br>无论是搭上这条命，还是要化身魔女，<br>我都要完成复仇——|#0102Adv12_Nanoka002| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛循着奈叶香的声音跑了过去。|#0102Adv12_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而，<br>那里已经空无一人。|#0102Adv12_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:（奈叶香……）|#0102Adv12_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想……和大家一起，活着离开这里啊。|#0102Adv12_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:无人回应她的低语。|#0102Adv12_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

